ss=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"14880572585349876286\"><a href=\"#14880572585349876286\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans7\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">JS handwriting ends; <a href=\"/person/william-wines-phelps\" class=\"referenceInPop\">William W. Phelps</a> begins.</p><hr></div></div></aside><span class=\"deleted\">Ah broam=ah brahoam <span class=\"josephswriting\">Ki Ahbraoam</span></span><aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"298583088024499606\"><a href=\"#298583088024499606\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans51\"><span id=\"documenttrans51\">51</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">TEXT: Probably “<span class=\"deleted\">Ahbraham</span> Ahbraoam”. <a href=\"/person/william-wines-phelps\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Phelps</a>’s “Ah broam=ah brahoam” and JS’s “Ki Ahbraoam” were separately canceled by short horizontal lines and then crossed out with one long line.</p><hr></div></div></aside><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span>&lt;​Ki-ah-bram, Ki-ah-bra-oam-Zub-sool-oan.​&gt;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"11215868065377051166\"><a href=\"#11215868065377051166\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans8\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of <a href=\"/person/oliver-cowdery\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Oliver Cowdery</a>.</p><hr></div></div></aside></td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td><td><span class=\"icon-glyph\">✦</span>