bet-circa-early-july-circa-november-1835-c\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/egyptian-alphabet-circa-early-july-circa-november-1835-c\" poptitle=\"Egyptian Alphabet, circa Early July–circa November\n 1835–C\">Egyptian Alphabet–C</a> has “ni tah”. The <a href=\"/paper-summary/grammar-and-alphabet-of-the-egyptian-language-circa-july-circa-november-1835/9\" class=\"externalLink\">Grammar and Alphabet</a> volume has several iterations of this transliteration, all of which begin with “Iota” and have “nitah”.</p><hr></div></div></aside> veh ah que</td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td><td><span class=\"icon-glyph\">✦</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">3.16</span>]</td><td><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span></td><td><span class=\"icon-glyph\">✦</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"icon-glyph\">✦</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">3.17a, b</span>]</td><td><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span></td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><div class=\" wasptag\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">&nbsp;</span></div><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span c